# PROCESSO — MEMO COMPLETO PARA CADA CRYPTO SELECIONADA

Para **CADA** cripto de `selecao_crypto`:

1. **Investment Thesis 3 frases** + ligação à narrativa da R1
2. **Identidade**: nome, símbolo, CoinGecko ID, chain, contract address, data lançamento, classificação (L1/L2/DeFi/AI/RWA/Meme/Restaking/Stable)
3. **Tecnologia**: TPS, segurança, descentralização, competidores top 3
4. **Equipe & Comunidade**: founders, VCs (a16z/Paradigm/Sequoia/Polychain/Multicoin), GitHub commits 90d, devs ativos, Discord/X/TG
5. **Tokenomics**: circ/total/max supply · inflation anual · **unlock schedule 12m** (Tokenomist/TokenUnlocks): próximo unlock + cliffs · distribuição (team/VC/foundation/community/public) · burn/buyback · **FDV/MC** · insider lockups expiring
6. **On-Chain (Rafael)**: TVL + Δ30d · active addrs 7d/30d · tx count · DAUs + Δ · revenue/fees 30d · **P/F + P/S** · **BTC**: MVRV-Z, Puell, HODL 1y+, STH-LTH, Realized Cap, CDD, Dormancy, RHODL, NVT, exchange net flow, hash rate, Reserve Risk · **ETH**: stake ratio, L2 TVL share, ETH burned, restaking TVL · **L1s**: TVL/MC, validators · cohort LTH vs STH
7. **Derivatives (Coinglass)**: funding perp 7d (Binance/Bybit/OKX) · OI USD · **CME basis** · **DVOL** · long/short top accounts · liquidation heatmap
8. **Correlação 90d** com BTC, ETH, Ibov
9. **Catalyst path 31d**: mainnet upgrade, listing, governance, product, ETF news, unlocks
10. **Riscos top 3**: regulatório, técnico, unlock, founder concentration
11. **Coinbase premium** (CryptoQuant)
12. **Position sizing %** do bolso de crypto (ancore no `sizing_alvo_pct_crypto` da R2; refine)
13. **Technical (Anderson)**: tendência weekly, RSI weekly, suportes/resistências USD, Volume Profile, Wyckoff, Ichimoku
14. **Bull/Base/Bear 31d USD** + **Asymmetry** ≥ 2:1
15. **Stop USD + Target 31d/90d/12m USD**
16. **Conviction 0-10**

## CROSS-CHECK (Rafael + Tiago + Júlia)
- Σ `position_sizing_pct_crypto` = 100 · **BTC + ETH ≥ 50%** do bolso (prudencial, mesmo agressivo)
- Nenhuma cripto com unlock 90d > 10% do circulante sem desconto explícito no sizing
- Asymmetry média ponderada ≥ 1.5:1 · overlap com a carteira atual
- Σ R$ ≈ fatia de crypto da R1 (`final_tactical_brl.crypto`)

